      "review_summary": "The PR adds stdout/stderr error handlers to file-transfer dir_fetch tar listing, uncompressed-budget validation, and unpack subprocess streams, with fail-closed stdout handling for the two data paths.\n\nPR surface: Source +26. Total +26 across 1 file.\n\nReproducibility: yes. source-reproducible for the underlying issue: current main consumes tar subprocess streams without output-stream error listeners, and a direct Node EventEmitter probe confirms unhandled error events throw. A real OpenClaw dir_fetch stream-error scenario has not been provided.",
